  "question": "Three of the following number pairs are alike in some manner and one is different. Select the odd number pair.\n\n(NOTE . The second number in the given number pairs is formed by performing a certain operation on the first number. The same operation is followed in all the number pairs except one. Find that odd number pair.)",
