  "solution": "**Logic :** (1st number ÷ 9) = 2nd number\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 297 : 33\n\n**297 ÷ 9**__ = 33\n\n33 = 33 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 189 : 21​\n\n​**189 ÷ 9**__ = 21\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 100 : 12​\n\n​**100 ÷ 9**__ = 12\n\n11.11 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 63 : 7\n\n**63 ÷ 9**__ = 7\n\n7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.\n\n9e:T13",
